  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n <head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n  <script async=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n  </script>\n  <script>\n   window.MathJax = {\n                        tex: {\n                        inlineMath: [\n                            [\"$\", \"$\"],\n                            [\"\\\\(\", \"\\\\)\"],\n                        ],\n                        displayMath: [\n                            [\"$$\", \"$$\"],\n                            [\"\\\\[\", \"\\\\]\"],\n                        ],\n                        processEscapes: true,\n                        processEnvironments: true,\n                        },\n                        options: {\n                        skipHtmlTags: [\"script\", \"noscript\", \"style\", \"textarea\", \"pre\"],\n                        },\n                    };\n                    if(window.MathJax && window.MathJax.typeset) {\n                        MathJax.Hub.Queue([\"Typeset\", MathJax.Hub]);\n                    }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n   table {\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        width: 100%;\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n        thead tr th {\n        border-top: 2px solid #000;\n        border-bottom: 2px solid #000;\n        padding: 8px;\n        background: #f6f6f6;\n        }\n        tbody td {\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: center;\n        }\n  </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\">(我的世界首个模组/数据包)</span></p>\n  <hr/>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"361\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_a926bc6e-7202-4d5d-b3ec-ad14554db92e.png\" width=\"808\"/></p>\n  <h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>史诗武士、史诗骑士、地牢武器，混乱之子，仅支持与Epic Fight、武器奇迹、史诗战斗风格等附加项兼容性极高的史诗剑类武器。</strong></h3>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>更有甚者！EFM兼容性的新纹理路径！</strong></h2>\n  <p> </p>\n  <hr/>\n  <h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">期望兼容</span></span></span> (<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">完整体验所需依赖项</span>):</h1>\n  <hr/>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"202\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/881/915/638312712562327674.png\" width=\"202\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> by maninthe_home/yesman</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"202\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/884/152/638318074504658168.png\" width=\"202\"/></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">武器奇迹</a> (wom) by reascer</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"202\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/915/178/638372918905326451.png\" width=\"202\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗风格</a> (ef-bs) by Forixaim</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"202\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/862/853/638271674802985984.png\" width=\"202\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗 - 关刀招式集</a> (falchionmoveset) by namelesslk</h4>\n  <p> </p>\n  <hr/>\n  <h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>请查看附加文件以下载资源包，修复并添加新纹理。</strong></h1>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(直到我弄明白如何将其与数据包内置化，否则这是获取纹理包的唯一方式)</strong></p>\n  <p><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"384\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_20d558b2-164b-4554-937a-789442eeaa53.png\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" width=\"721\"/></strong></p>\n  <h3 style=\"text-align:center\"> </h3>\n  <p> </p>\n  <hr/>\n  <h1 style=\"text-align:center\">推荐：</h1>\n  <hr/>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"logo\" height=\"160\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/963/317/638461000018381994.png\" width=\"160\"/></a></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight x Iron的魔法盔甲修复</a>&nbsp;by cacheing</p>\n  <h3 style=\"text-align:center\">此数据包/模组旨在让Epic Fight与各种模组兼容。基于个人喜好修改武器招式，请随意按自己的喜好进行定制。</h3>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>尝试你独有的战斗风格：</strong></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">如何为Epic Fight创建自定义武器和盔甲的数据包：</h4>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f%2523onetwo-handed-weapon-file\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://epicfight-docs.readthedocs.io/Guides/page2/#onetwo-handed-weapon-file</a></h4>\n  <hr/>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align:center\">武器来源：</h2>\n  <hr/>\n  <p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"202\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/778/486/638122554849559119.png\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" width=\"202\"/></a>   &nbsp;  </p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">混沌之子</a> by mongoose_artist</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/805/606/638172713304550451.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗武士</a> by VeroxUniverse</h4>\n  <p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Epic Knights\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/411/944/637630777607986862.png\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a>/magistuarmory by magistu_</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/789/196/638143347801778495.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢武器</a> by thespringaling</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/611/576/637996129346404798.gif\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">-简单之剑</a> by sweenuss</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/190/975/636857615673605328.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰与火：龙</a>&nbsp;by sbom_xela</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/937/893/638416517376113534.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC地牢武器</a> by chronos_sacaria</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/892/693/638335183690820532.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士附加包</a> by magistu_</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/464/755/637744772991786976.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamarine</a> by Obscuria</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/897/696/638342973699298752.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">传奇 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">武器库</a></a> by DaddyUnion</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/396/11/637595005615179370.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农民的欢乐</a> by verctorwing</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/871/265/638288661913483053.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron的魔法与法典</a> by Iron431</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/460/870/637739722679428303.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's大灾变</a> by mcl_ender</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/506/233/637824423557821613.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\">圣遗物转生</a> by P3pp3rF1y</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/258/931/637209858883035931.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\">吸血鬼 - 成为吸血鬼！</a> by maxanier and Cheaterpaul</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/566/189/637924794889476652.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dave的药草学</a> by SoterDave</h4>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">以太</a>&nbsp;by TheAetherTeam</strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/883/158/638315999771583464.gif\" width=\"200\"/></strong></a></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">基础武器</a> by Khazoda</strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/838/790/638231371029924457.png\" width=\"200\"/></strong></a></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">生命魔法</a> by Elenterius</strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/241/891/637131079632015619.png\" width=\"200\"/></strong></a></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">湛蓝天空</a> by ModdingLegacy</strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/798/638390956074205375.png\" width=\"200\"/></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/851/638391125861006765.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus:奥术</a> by Nokunami</strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/834/456/638225202891768109.png\" width=\"200\"/></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/889/312/638328880372078491.png\" width=\"200\"/></a></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗圣骑士</a> &amp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(38, 38, 38)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗帝国</a> by VeroxUniverse</strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/772/533/638112628921999420.png\" width=\"200\"/></strong></a></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁断奥术</a> by cesar_zorak</strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/761/310/638097611993061146.png\" width=\"200\"/></strong></a></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">扈从的需求</a> by KodoDenka</strong></p>\n </body>\n</html><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/796/600/638156948581632807.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 Weaponry</a> by Icy0x1</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/555/994/637900334510568136.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">-RPG Style </a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">More</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Weapons!</a> by zrikon</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/614/129/637997268560849585.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Weapons for Better Combat</a><em> &lt;s&gt;(Now for Epic Fight!)&lt;/s&gt;&nbsp;</em>by InfernalEclipse</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/14/212/635589178760357568.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> by Benimatic</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/280/925/637283672869883111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a> by Quek04</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/679/638025764121686580.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plus the End</a> by praizazdd7724 (only for 1.8)</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/887/654/638325263575103332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">EEEAB's Mobs</a> by EEEAB</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>And even more in the future!...</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Other compabilities:</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/825/222/638210773187460598.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Recruits</a> by talhanation</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/896/228/638341222431292689.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics Of Gaming Continued</a> (Only Trails were changed) by power282</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Datapack made by <strong>ElC4</strong> with the contribution of Йохан Петрович, based of others datapack like:</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-simplyswords with epicfight by sunwoolove777</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-epic-knights-EFM from (epic knights discord server)</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Q&amp;A</h1>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Can you add this mod [insert any weapons mod]?</strong></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>I am aware about the mods that are suggested in the comments section, once I take time to work in the mod im going to test the mods to see how compatible are they with Epic Fight, some mods like Weapons Masters that have his own battle mechanic so trying to force it to work with Epic Fight will do a mess. Thats why they should be tested first.</em></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">This being my first datapack/mod kinda means that I just jump in a giant pool without knowing how to properly swim, I don't know to much about Java and I still don't understand how it works with minecraft mods but im learning. Also I am a student so probably im geting busy with some stuff and most of my free time im playing something else, hope you understand.</p>\n<p>Also sorry if I misspell something english is not my first language.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
